{
  "id": 10456779554997,
  "title": "8.5' X 24' Black Custom Enclosed Trailer For Marketing and Showcase Events",
  "body_html": "<h2>8.5' X 24' Black Custom Enclosed Trailer For Marketing and Showcase Events</h2>\n<p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><span>Make a powerful impression at your next marketing activation, showcase, promotional event, or live production with this professionally equipped 8.5' x 24' Black Custom Enclosed Trailer. Designed for versatility, visibility, and reliable performance, this trailer combines a fully functional 16' stage, rear ramp/stage system, premium electrical capabilities, climate control, and extensive event-ready features. Whether you're showcasing products, hosting brand activations, supporting live entertainment, or creating an immersive mobile experience, this trailer is built to make your event stand out.</span></p>\n<h3><span>Trailer &amp; Construction Features</span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong><span>Trailer Size:</span></strong><span> 8.5' x 24' \u2014 spacious enough to accommodate equipment, displays, staff, and event materials while remaining highly maneuverable.</span>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong><span>Interior Height:</span></strong><span> 8' \u2014 provides a comfortable, open interior workspace with plenty of usable vertical clearance.</span>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong><span>Exterior Finish:</span></strong><span> Black exterior with </span>Blackout trim<span> for a sleek, professional appearance that commands attention at events and promotional activations.</span>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong><span>Trailer Axles:</span></strong><span> (2) 7,000 lb axles with brakes for dependable towing performance and increased load capacity.</span>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong><span>Wheels &amp; Tires:</span></strong><span> Premium Mags with heavy-duty </span>14-ply tires<span> for durability and a rugged commercial appearance.</span>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong><span>Extended Tongue:</span></strong><span> Provides additional clearance and improved maneuverability.</span>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong><span>Generator Platform:</span></strong><span> Conveniently positioned platform for mounting a generator and supporting mobile power needs.</span>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong><span>Standard Entry Door:</span></strong><span> 36\" x 78\" entry door for easy personnel access.</span>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong><span>Crank Jacks:</span></strong><span> Heavy-duty crank jacks at all four corners for stability and secure setup.</span>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong><span>Roller Wheels:</span></strong><span> Added convenience for maneuvering and positioning the trailer during setup.</span>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong><span>Stone Guard:</span></strong><span> Standard stone guard helps protect the front of the trailer from road debris.</span>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><span>Stage &amp; Event Features</span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong><span>16' Stage:</span></strong><span> Large integrated stage designed for product showcases, live presentations, demonstrations, entertainment, promotional events, and brand activations.</span>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong><span>16' Stage Support System:</span></strong><span> Includes (4) crank jack supports for added stability during stage operation and event use.</span>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong><span>Black 48\" Stage Railings:</span></strong><span> Provides a finished, professional appearance while adding an important safety barrier around the elevated stage.</span>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong><span>Fender Insert:</span></strong><span> Integrated fender insert helps create a clean and functional stage configuration.</span>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong><span>(2) Stage Entry Gates:</span></strong><span> Convenient access points for performers, presenters, staff, and equipment.</span>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong><span>(2) Sets of Stage Steps:</span></strong><span> Provides easy and convenient access to the elevated stage.</span>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong><span>8' Rear Ramp Door/Stage:</span></strong><span> Additional functional outdoor space for loading, presentations, displays, or event activities.</span>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong><span>Rear Ramp/Stage Winch:</span></strong><span> Winch-assisted operation helps simplify setup and deployment.</span>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong><span>(2) Crank Jack Supports:</span></strong><span> Provides additional stability for the rear ramp/stage configuration.</span>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong><span>Black 48\" Rear Railings:</span></strong><span> Matches the main stage for a cohesive, professional event presentation.</span>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong><span>(2) Rear Entry Gates:</span></strong><span> Allows convenient access to and from the rear stage area.</span>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong><span>(2) Sets of Rear Steps:</span></strong><span> Provides practical access to the rear ramp/stage area.</span>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><span>Electrical &amp; Climate Control</span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong><span>100 Amp Electrical Package:</span></strong><span> Provides substantial electrical capacity for event equipment, displays, lighting, audio equipment, and other electrical demands.</span>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong><span>20 Amp Plugs with Independent Circuits:</span></strong><span> Allows multiple pieces of equipment to operate efficiently without relying on a single circuit.</span>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong><span>50 Amp Motor Base Plug:</span></strong><span> Provides a dedicated external power connection for convenient electrical service.</span>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong><span>18K BTU Mini Split:</span></strong><span> Provides efficient heating and cooling to help maintain a comfortable interior environment during events and extended use.</span>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong><span>Mini Split Protective Cage:</span></strong><span> Helps protect the exterior HVAC equipment from accidental damage.</span>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong><span>(2) Powered Roof Vents:</span></strong><span> Provides powered ventilation to help circulate air and improve interior airflow.</span>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><span>Interior Features</span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong><span>White Aluminum Wall Covering:</span></strong><span> Creates a bright, clean, professional interior that is ideal for marketing displays, product showcases, branding, and event preparation.</span>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong><span>RTP Flooring Throughout:</span></strong><span> Durable flooring designed to withstand demanding commercial and event use while being easy to maintain.</span>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong><span>48' of Floor E-Track:</span></strong><span> Extensive E-Track provides flexible tie-down points for securing equipment, displays, merchandise, cases, and other cargo during transport.</span>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong><span>(8) Interior Lights:</span></strong><span> Provides bright, practical illumination throughout the enclosed workspace.</span>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><span>Exterior &amp; Event Lighting</span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong><span>(9) Exterior Lights:</span></strong><span> Provides enhanced visibility around the trailer for nighttime events, setup, breakdown, and promotional activities.</span>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong><span>18' Armless Awning:</span></strong><span> Creates valuable covered space along the side of the trailer for customer interaction, product demonstrations, displays, ticketing, hospitality, or event operations.</span>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><span>Audio &amp; Entertainment</span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong><span>Stereo Package:</span></strong><span> Integrated audio system designed to support event announcements, music, presentations, promotional activities, and entertainment.</span>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong><span>(4) Speakers:</span></strong><span> Includes </span>(2) interior speakers and (2) exterior speakers<span> for versatile sound coverage inside and around the trailer.</span>\n</li>\n</ul>",
